            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按断开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to restore internet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按恢复上网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target Node / Group": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标节点/分组"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target Policy": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标策略"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell Tono support when this app crashed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用崩溃时告知 Tono 技术支持"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Latency": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试延迟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test current exit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试当前节点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Tono home transport stopped and no managed cloud exit is available. Internet remains blocked by the kill switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "家宽线路已中断，而且现在没有可用的云端节点。断网保护仍在拦住直接上网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The active network changed; Kill Switch is blocking traffic while Tono protects the new connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前网络已切换。断网保护正在阻断流量，Tono 正在保护新的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The authenticated helper did not start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已认证的网络组件未能启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The authenticated network helper is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已认证的网络组件不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection attempt stalled and was stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接尝试长时间无进展，已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current device cannot revoke itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前设备无法撤销自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed network helper no longer accepts this copy of Tono. Click Retry and approve the administrator prompt to repair it, or run the documented sudo emergency-disarm command and reopen Tono. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的网络组件不再接受这份 Tono。点按「重试」并在管理员弹窗中确认以修复，或运行文档中的 sudo 紧急解除命令后重新打开 Tono。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed network helper rejected this copy of Tono.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的网络组件拒绝了这份 Tono。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS protected DNS path did not pass its end-to-end check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 的受保护 DNS 通道未通过端到端检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network helper closed the connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络组件关闭了连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network helper returned an invalid response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络组件返回了无效响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The requested item no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求的对象已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same failure repeated three times, so automatic retries are paused. Tap Retry Now to try again, or Protected Offline to restore normal Internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一错误已连续出现三次，自动重试已暂停。点按「立即重试」再试一次，或点按「恢复正常网络」恢复上网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected cloud server was removed. Kill Switch is still blocking traffic; choose another cloud server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选云端节点已被移除。断网保护仍在拦住直连，请另选一个云端节点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected cloud server was removed. Tono switched to the managed default cloud server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选云端节点已被移除，Tono 已切换到受管的默认云端节点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected node is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选节点当前不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme Mode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has no network connection. Protection resumes automatically when the network returns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前物理网络不可用。网络恢复后会自动继续保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is still using Encrypted DNS or iCloud Private Relay, so apps bypass Tono's protected resolver. Turn Encrypted DNS and Private Relay off, then reconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 仍在使用加密 DNS 或 iCloud 私密转发，应用会绕过 Tono 的受保护解析器。请关闭加密 DNS 与私密转发，然后重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Tono account cannot connect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Tono 账户无法连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Tono account has reached its device allowance. Revoke another device first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Tono 账户已达到设备数量上限，请先撤销另一台设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Tono account is not active. Contact Tono support to restore access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Tono 账户当前不可用，请联系 Tono 客服恢复访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Tono plan has expired. Renew it to keep connecting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Tono 套餐已到期，续费后即可继续连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Tono plan has used its full data allowance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Tono 套餐的流量额度已用完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account does not have permission for that action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此账户没有执行该操作的权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is exactly what Tono reports when support requests a diagnostic snapshot. It carries no hostnames, IP addresses, process names or account tokens.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这就是技术支持索取诊断快照时 Tono 会上报的全部内容，其中不含主机名、IP 地址、进程名或账号令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is exactly what Tono reports when support requests a diagnostic snapshot. It carries no hostnames, IP addresses, process names or account tokens. It is a separate, smaller report than the audit log above, which in this test build is uploaded in full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这正是支持团队请求诊断快照时 Tono 上报的内容。其中不含主机名、IP 地址、进程名或账号令牌。它与上面的审计日志是两份不同的报告，体积更小；审计日志在这个测试版本中会被完整上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is what Tono reports when support requests a diagnostic snapshot, followed by the catalog and traffic-policy state the uploaded snapshot has no field for. It carries no hostnames, IP addresses, process names or account tokens. It is a separate, smaller report than the audit log above, which in this test build is uploaded in full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是支持团队索取诊断快照时 Tono 会上报的内容，后面附上了上传的快照没有字段承载的目录与分流策略状态。其中不含主机名、IP 地址、进程名或账户令牌。它与上面的审计日志是两份不同的报告，后者在此测试版本中会被完整上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Throughput over the last minute": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近一分钟的吞吐量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timeout": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To work reliably, Tono must run from the Applications folder. Quit Tono, drag it onto Applications in the installer window, then open the installed copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为确保 Tono 稳定运行，必须从「应用程序」文件夹启动。请退出 Tono，在安装窗口中将它拖到「应用程序」，然后打开已安装的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokyo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "东京"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono": {},
    "Tono Account": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 账户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono Protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono account suspended": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 账户已被停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono could not release a protection state left by an earlier session. Run the documented sudo emergency-disarm command, then reopen Tono. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 无法解除上一次会话遗留的保护状态。请运行文档中的 sudo 紧急解除命令，然后重新打开 Tono。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono does not expose the protected route to LAN clients.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 不会把受保护线路开放给局域网客户端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono has to quit and reopen to change languages. This Mac is protected right now, so the connection is dropped and Kill Switch is released until you connect again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改语言需要退出并重新打开 Tono。这台 Mac 当前处于受保护状态，连接会被断开，断网保护也会解除，直到你再次连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono keeps Rule mode locked so traffic cannot bypass the protected cloud route.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 锁定规则模式，以防流量绕过受保护的云端线路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono keeps one local, redacted log file. Support may call it the audit log or the diagnostics log — it is the same file. Credentials and URL queries are removed before anything is written.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 只保留一份本地脱敏日志。技术支持可能称它为审计日志或诊断日志——指的是同一个文件。凭据与 URL 查询参数在写入前已被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono keeps one redacted log file. Support may call it the audit log or the diagnostics log — it is the same file. Credentials and URL queries are removed before anything is written, and TLS bodies are never observed. In this test build the file is also uploaded to Tono support so routing bugs can be diagnosed without asking you for it; it carries the hostnames you connected to, the process that opened each connection, and which rule and route it matched. Settings › Privacy turns the upload off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 只保留一份已脱敏的日志文件。支持团队可能称它为审计日志或诊断日志——是同一份文件。凭据和 URL 查询参数在写入前已被移除，TLS 内容从不被读取。在这个测试版本中，该文件还会上传给 Tono 支持团队，以便无需向你索取即可排查路由问题；其中包含你连接过的主机名、发起每条连接的进程，以及命中的规则与路由。可在「设置 › 隐私」中关闭上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono may ask for administrator access to install its signed network helper — this is what routes and protects your traffic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 可能会请求管理员权限来安装签名网络组件——它负责路由并保护你的流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono quit unexpectedly on %@ · %@ · build %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 曾于 %1$@ 意外退出 · %2$@ · 构建 %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono requires TUN mode while cloud protection is active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云端保护启用期间，Tono 必须使用 TUN 模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono returned an invalid response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 返回了无效响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono service is not configured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 服务尚未配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono sign-in is temporarily unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 登录暂时不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono's network helper needs repair before protection can be released, so your traffic stays protected. Choose Restore internet again and approve the administrator prompt. If repair keeps failing, the Support page has a recovery command. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 的网络助手需要修复后才能解除保护，你的流量仍处于保护中。请再次选择「恢复联网」并在管理员提示中授权。若修复持续失败，支持页面提供了一条恢复命令。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono's network helper rejected this copy of Tono, so automatic retries are paused. Choose Repair and reconnect to reinstall the helper, or Restore internet to turn protection off. If repair keeps failing, the Support page has a recovery command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 的网络助手拒绝了当前这份 Tono，自动重试已暂停。请选择「修复并重新连接」以重新安装助手，或选择「恢复正常网络」以关闭保护。若修复反复失败，「支持与诊断」页面提供了恢复命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合计"
          }
        }
      }
