          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The following traffic is transparently captured via TUN virtual adapter and forwarded through high-reputation residential broadband exits to prevent IP flagging:\n\n• Anthropic Core Services: *.anthropic.com, *.claude.ai\n• Cloudflare Turnstile Verification: challenges.cloudflare.com, cf-assets.www.cloudflare.com\n• Telemetry & Feature Flags: *.datadoghq.com, *.statsigapi.net, *.stripe.network\n• Local Developer Apps: Claude Code CLI, Claude Desktop\n\nZero terminal configuration required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The following traffic is transparently captured via TUN virtual adapter and forwarded through high-reputation residential broadband exits to prevent IP flagging:\n\n• Anthropic Core Services: *.anthropic.com, *.claude.ai\n• Cloudflare Turnstile Verification: challenges.cloudflare.com, cf-assets.www.cloudflare.com\n• Telemetry & Feature Flags: *.datadoghq.com, *.statsigapi.net, *.stripe.network\n• Local Developer Apps: Claude Code CLI, Claude Desktop\n\nZero terminal configuration required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下流量通过纯 TUN 虚拟网卡透明接管，并通过高信用家庭宽带跳点转发，免除数据中心 IP 风控：\n\n• Anthropic 核心服务：*.anthropic.com, *.claude.ai\n• 人机安全验证：challenges.cloudflare.com, cf-assets.www.cloudflare.com\n• 遥测与灰度：*.datadoghq.com, *.statsigapi.net, *.stripe.network\n• 本地应用进程：Claude Code、Claude Desktop\n\n终端零代理配置，开箱即用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code / Terminal Environment Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code / Terminal Environment Diagnostics"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code / 终端开发环境体检"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxy Residue Detected": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Residue Detected"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现代理残留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Environment Ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environment Ready"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "环境就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Residual HTTP_PROXY environment variables detected. This often causes terminal tools (like Claude Code CLI) to fail with connection refused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Residual HTTP_PROXY environment variables detected. This often causes terminal tools (like Claude Code CLI) to fail with connection refused."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测到系统或进程中存在残留代理配置。这可能导致终端软件（如 Claude Code CLI）报错并拒绝连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System environment variables are clean. Terminal traffic is transparently routed via Tono TUN virtual adapter. Claude Code, git, npm, and pip work out-of-the-box without manual proxy configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System environment variables are clean. Terminal traffic is transparently routed via Tono TUN virtual adapter. Claude Code, git, npm, and pip work out-of-the-box without manual proxy configuration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端环境正常。流量直接由 Tono TUN 虚拟网卡透明接管，Claude Code、git、npm、pip 开箱即用，无需配置代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking terminal proxy sources…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查终端代理来源…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some terminal proxy sources could not be inspected. Tono will not report the environment as ready until the scan completes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分终端代理来源无法检查。扫描完整完成前，Tono 不会将环境报告为就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan Incomplete": {
