      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在新 shell 中清除大写和小写代理变量：unset HTTP_PROXY HTTPS_PROXY ALL_PROXY http_proxy https_proxy all_proxy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After fixing every listed source, fully restart Tono, open terminals, VS Code, and Claude Code together with any supervisor or parent process that launched it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修复所有列出的来源后，请彻底重启 Tono、已打开的终端、VS Code、Claude Code，以及启动它的 supervisor 或父进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
