    "Remove the proxy key from the managed Claude settings source, then fully restart Claude Code and its supervisor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 Claude 托管设置来源中移除代理键，然后彻底重启 Claude Code 及其 supervisor。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove the proxy key from the env object, then fully restart Claude Code and its supervisor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 env 对象中移除代理键，然后彻底重启 Claude Code 及其 supervisor。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove the proxy key from the project env object, then fully restart Claude Code and its supervisor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从项目 env 对象中移除代理键，然后彻底重启 Claude Code 及其 supervisor。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove the proxy key from terminal.integrated.env.osx, then fully restart VS Code and every integrated terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 terminal.integrated.env.osx 中移除代理键，然后彻底重启 VS Code 和每个集成终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VS Code user settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VS Code 用户设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VS Code profile settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VS Code 配置文件设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All browser profiles share Tono's routing. Tono only reads these settings; it never changes browser preferences or routes an entire browser process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有浏览器配置文件共用 Tono 的路由。Tono 只读取这些设置；它不会更改浏览器偏好设置，也不会按整个浏览器进程路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocking": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阻断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browser Secure DNS": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器安全 DNS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking Chrome and Microsoft Edge…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查 Chrome 和 Microsoft Edge…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome and Microsoft Edge use Tono's protected system DNS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome 和 Microsoft Edge 正在使用 Tono 受保护的系统 DNS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chrome or Microsoft Edge may bypass Tono's protected DNS. Turn off Secure DNS in Chrome and Edge for all profiles, fully restart the browsers, then reconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chrome 或 Microsoft Edge 可能绕过 Tono 的受保护 DNS。请在 Chrome 和 Edge 的所有配置文件中关闭安全 DNS，彻底重启浏览器，然后重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microsoft Edge": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microsoft Edge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure DNS can bypass Tono. Turn it off in Chrome and Edge for all profiles, fully restart the browsers, then reconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全 DNS 可能绕过 Tono。请在 Chrome 和 Edge 的所有配置文件中关闭它，彻底重启浏览器，然后重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser DNS scan was incomplete. Tono fails closed when a residential Claude route is configured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器 DNS 扫描未完成。配置 Claude 住宅线路时，Tono 会以故障关闭方式阻止连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
